Consolidation candidate on heydemoura/EglantinePS5 28d3d90.
Sources: viejunerd/Eglantine-PS5- 6243701 (patches 0072, 0077, 0080, 0081).
Original authors and licenses retained. The last three are Lichii fixes
carried by viejunerd commit 01bdcbb; texture staging is from 6273324.

Bounds layered uploads, counts nested returns before shader demotes,
serializes dirty-memory gathering and prevents lost worker cancellation wakes.

Partial integration only: NUP/DLC loader, v1.219.029 storage-size guard,
ReserveOver allocator changes and PS5_Lichii/Fritchii-specific features
still need porting and validation. This patch is not a full fork merger.
